# moment kind=street3d cam=worm near=1.0 traffic=34 title="7,000,000|MOTORBIKES" titleAt=.15 capAt=.3 dur=4.5
How do you cross a street with seven million motorbikes?

# moment kind=street3d path="0,22,-20,0,-36,46@0|-1,2.4,-9,3,1,48@7" traffic=30 trans=cut
In the next four minutes: the five rules locals use…
…the sound that isn't rude…
…and the one vehicle that never, ever gives way.

# chapter num=1 text="Seven million motorbikes"
Chapter one. Seven million motorbikes.

# moment kind=street3d cam=crane rise=.6 traffic=40 trans=cut
Vietnam has around seventy-three million registered motorbikes.
Hà Nội alone has nearly seven million.
In the Old Quarter, the streets are narrow, the bikes are everywhere, and the traffic lights are… suggestions.

# moment kind=street3d cam=ots traffic=32 trans=cut
Which brings us to Dave.

# dialogue a=dave b=copho place=oldquarter time=sunset voiceA=am_puck voiceB=af_bella act="copho:point" lines="a:scared:How do I get across?|b:smug:Like a buffalo.|a:thinking:…A buffalo?|b:neutral:Slow. Steady. Never panics.|a:nervous:And the bikes?|b:smug:They go around the buffalo."

# chapter num=2 text="The river"
Chapter two. The river.

# moment kind=shot_bird dur=7 trans=cut
Here's the secret. Riders aren't trying to hit you. They're reading you.
Every rider is guessing where you'll be in one second.
Be easy to guess, and the river flows around you.

# chapter num=3 text="Five rules"
Chapter three. Five rules.

# moment kind=street3d cam=side walk="0.6-2.6:-4.6>3.5" mode=run traffic=34 title="RULE #1|NEVER RUN" titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule one: never run.
Running changes your speed. The riders' guesses are suddenly wrong.

# moment kind=shot_eyes dur=2.6 trans=cut
Dave ran.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close walk="0.4-4.4:-4.6>4.4" mode=stop near=2.1 dave="0,14" traffic=30 title="RULE #2|NO SUDDEN STOPS" titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule two: no sudden stops.
Freeze in the middle, and the bike aiming behind you has nowhere to go.

# moment kind=street3d cam=high walk="0.2-7:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes traffic=32 title="RULE #3|SLOW AND STEADY" titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule three: walk slowly, at the same speed, all the way across.
Same speed every step, so every rider can plan around you.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close walk="0.2-7:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes hand=yes traffic=28 title="RULE #4|LOOK. RAISE A HAND." titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule four: make eye contact with the riders coming at you. Raise a hand.
You're not stopping traffic. You're saying: I'm here, I'm crossing, I'm predictable.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close bus=.2 dave="0,14" pose=scared expr=shocked traffic=20 title="RULE #5|BUSES WIN" titleAt=1.2 trans=cut
Rule five: buses and trucks don't flow.
They're big, they're slow to stop, and they block other riders' view of you.
Let them pass. Every time.

# chapter num=4 text="The sound that isn't rude"
Chapter four. The sound that isn't rude.

# moment kind=shot_eyes dur=3 trans=cut
Beep. Beep beep. Beeeep.

# moment kind=street3d cam=eye traffic=30 trans=cut
Here, a horn isn't anger. It's a polite heads-up: I'm behind you. I'm passing.
So don't jump. Keep your pace.

# chapter num=5 text="Lights and crossings"
Chapter five. Lights and crossings.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close dave="-4.6,14" pose=think traffic=26 trans=cut
Use zebra crossings and traffic lights when you find them.
But a green man doesn't mean the road is empty. Turning bikes may have a green too.
Look both ways. Then look again.

# chapter num=6 text="Easier ways"
Chapter six. Easier ways.

# moment kind=street3d time=day ev=yes traffic=8 path="0,20,-14,0,-30,46@0|0,9,-8,0,-14,46@7" title="SINCE JULY 2026|HOÀN KIẾM GOES ELECTRIC" titleAt=.3 trans=lightleak
Since July 2026, Hà Nội has been piloting a phase-out of petrol motorbikes…
…on the streets around Hoàn Kiếm Lake.
The plan widens to the Old Quarter in 2027, and Ring Road 1 in 2028.
And from Friday at 7 pm to Sunday midnight, the lake streets close to traffic. Walk anywhere.

# list host=copho place=oldquarter time=sunset capY=.86 title="NOT IN THE MOOD?" items="Walking streets · Fri 7 pm to Sun midnight|Grab bike or car|Xe ôm with a helmet|Electric buggy around the lake"
Not in the mood to cross?
Take a Grab, a xe ôm with a helmet, or an electric buggy around the lake.

# chapter num=7 text="Dave's turn"
Chapter seven. Dave's turn.

# moment kind=street3d cam=chase walk="0.2-6:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes done=6.1 copho="5.4,14.6" traffic=26 trans=cut
Slow. Steady. Eye contact. Hand up.
Dave crosses.
Alive.

