# list host=copho place=oldquarter time=sunset capY=.86 title="HOW TO CROSS" items="Walk slow and steady|Never run|No sudden stops|Eye contact, raise a hand|!Buses win: let them pass"
Slow and steady. Never run. No sudden stops. Eye contact. And buses always win.

